# @hub-lanes

# ── MIGRATION LANE (BH-8704) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 min the dispatcher (lane migration-lane) starts one run of lane
# `migration` per fleet project (bin/lib/project-lanes.sh). A project whose
# mc_migration_hold.apply_lane.<project> row is `migration` lands up to
# lane.migration.<project>.batch_max ready migration PRs as ONE batch (one CI,
# apply through the project's ledger CLI, one merge per PR); every other
# project exits at once. Gated on the hub lease (BH-1000). Off:
# flags/lane-off-migration-lane (dispatcher), flags/lane-off-migration (the
# runs), flags/automerge-disabled[-<project>].
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/migration-lane.sh >> /root/harness/logs/migration-lane-cron.log 2>&1
